{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415030","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041503001:1":{"text":"儚さこそが美なのです。","source_cn":"美，应当是漂浮无定的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF676E992D8B0817A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503002:1":{"text":"瞬く間に生まれ、次の瞬間には消えてゆく……","source_cn":"在转瞬间诞生，又在下一秒消逝……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E3E22838C47AB63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503003:1":{"text":"それは幻想なのか現実なのか……真実の美とは、つかみどころのないものなのです。","source_cn":"无法判断究竟是幻象而是真实，那样的迷惘带来的美丽，反而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4150B23BB456C249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503004:1":{"text":"その曖昧な物言い、そなたの美的感覚そのものですね。まったくの無価値。","source_cn":"混乱不堪的说法，和你的审美一样不值一提。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F7741CE0DDB6729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503005:1":{"text":"美とは確固たるものであり、不変なのです。\nそれゆえ人を惹きつける。","source_cn":"美丽是坚定的，无可改变的。\\n正因如此，才是所谓的魅力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5592C43879C2C23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503006:1":{"text":"そなたの美的感覚は、あのベリル氏よりも私を不快にさせる。","source_cn":"比起贝利尔那家伙，你的审美情趣更让我感到不快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F88828D088F8699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503007:1":{"text":"へぇ、初めて気が合いましたね。私もまったく同じことを考えていました。","source_cn":"呵，真巧，在这一点上我们居然取得了唯一的共识。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB455DF100BE5C357","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:普鲁斯托":{"text":"プルースト","source":"普鲁斯托","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雷内亚":{"text":"エニエ","source":"雷内亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}